; Split Relay start time script v1
; Sends each race's event number, round, heat and start time of day (TOD) to Split Relay,
; so Split Relay sets that race's gun from FinishLynx. One complete JSON object per line.
; Needs FinishLynx 9.10 or newer: field \14\19 is the participant's start time (the same as in the .lif file).
;
; Setup (a scoreboard of its own, beside TrackScore's):
;  1. Copy this file to C:\Lynx and restart FinishLynx.
;  2. Scoreboard > Options for a new scoreboard: Serial Port = Network (Connect),
;     IP Address = 127.0.0.1 (or the Split Relay PC's address), Port = 5570.
;  3. Script = SplitRelay-Start.lss.
;  4. Results = Auto, Paging ON, Size = 1, Time = 0 ("one at a time": FinishLynx then sends
;     start times when a start is created, deleted or edited).
;
;      \11  Time
;         \00  No variable
;         \01  Formatted time
;      \13  Results Header/Trailer
;         \00  No variable
;         \01  OFFICIAL/UNOFFICIAL string
;         \02  Event name
;         \04  Event number
;         \05  Round number
;         \06  Heat number
;         \07  AUTO/MANUAL start type
;         \09  ARMED/RUNNING status
;      \14  Result
;         \00  No variable
;         \01  Place
;         \03  Id (Bib)
;         \19  Start time (time of day, as in the .lif file)
;         \1a  Start time in Time Trial mode (only when there is a key match)

;;TimeArmed
\11\00{"c":"armed"}\0d\0a

;;TimeGun
\11\01{"c":"gun","t":"%s"}\0d\0a

;;StartList
\14\00{"c":"start","T":"L",
\13\04"EN":"%s",
\13\05"R":"%s",
\13\06"H":"%s",
\13\02"DN":"%s",
\13\07"SA":"%s",
\13\09"ST":"%s",
\14\03"BIB":"%s",
\14\19"TOD":"%s",
\14\1a"TT":"%s"
\14\00}\0d\0a

;;Started
\14\00{"c":"start","T":"T",
\13\04"EN":"%s",
\13\05"R":"%s",
\13\06"H":"%s",
\13\02"DN":"%s",
\13\07"SA":"%s",
\13\09"ST":"%s",
\14\01"P":"%s",
\14\03"BIB":"%s",
\14\19"TOD":"%s",
\14\1a"TT":"%s"
\14\00}\0d\0a

;;Results
\14\00{"c":"start","T":"R",
\13\04"EN":"%s",
\13\05"R":"%s",
\13\06"H":"%s",
\13\02"DN":"%s",
\13\07"SA":"%s",
\13\09"ST":"%s",
\14\01"P":"%s",
\14\03"BIB":"%s",
\14\19"TOD":"%s",
\14\1a"TT":"%s"
\14\00}\0d\0a
